{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい♪  走る"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやくー( *´ヮ`* )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかが撮ってくれた、はしゃぐ私（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、乃木坂に入って初めての\n「夏休み」というものを頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難い(,,> <,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、まりかと2人で\n1泊2日、富山県に行ってきたよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セルフタイマーで撮ったら変な瞬間の撮れた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度、五箇山の世界遺産にお泊りしてみたかったんです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうのほほんとした場所がすきで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"庭園とか温泉とか特撮とか旅とか...今どきの女の子ぽくないね、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅弁を買ってわくわくしながら新幹線に乗って、\n夕方、富山に着くと、途端にまさかのどしゃぶり...(*_*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は花火をしたかったけど、大人しく民宿でゆっくり過ごして、\n美味しいご飯を食べたり、他愛ない話をしたり。\nそれはそれで素敵でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京でお仕事してるといつの間にかどんどん季節が過ぎてたりするけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって、時間の流れをゆっくり感じとったり、\n雨の音とか、木々の揺れる音とか、虫の鳴き声とか... まじまじと聴くの、\nなんだか久しぶりなような気がして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼い頃を思い出すような、幸せな気持ちになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは一緒にお風呂に入って、\n(一人で入るの怖かったから一緒に入った笑)\n畳の上にお布団を敷いて、\n明日は晴れるといいなあ...って願いながらおやすみしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝は2人して6時に起きて、お散歩をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外へ出たら、なんと晴れてる！！！\n神さま...(´•̥̥̥  •̥̥̥`)有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも雲が近くてビックリ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天国かここは...！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空気が美味しかった...(๑´﹃`)もぐもぐ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泊まった民宿も含め、全てがまるでタイムスリップしたかのような、\n日本昔話の世界に入ってしまったかのような、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しい時間に包まれていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のどか〜(*´＿`*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1時間くらいお散歩したあと、朝ごはんを頂きました。\n野菜やお魚の美味しさに、なんと2杯もごはんおかわりしちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胃腸の弱い小食な自分がこんなに食べれるんだ、って自分でも驚き。笑\n本当に美味しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"民宿を出たあとは、2人でバスに乗って温泉に行って、景色のいい露天風呂に長湯して、フヤフヤにふやけました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花のフェスティバル？も見に行って、球根も買ってきました。\n帰ってきて早速植えたので、咲くのが楽しみですo(*^▽^*)oキレイな花が咲くかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じで、のんびり楽い旅でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか、有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真がこれ以上載せれないので、\nだいぶ厳選しちゃいました(*_*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ載せきてれないやつは、モバメで沢山送るねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも休み中、いっぱい色んなところに行ったので、\nその続きは次のブログに書きますっ(´,,･ω･,,`)待っててね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、良かったら、今日の\nNOGIBINGO!5見てください(ฅωฅ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妄想リクエストは何度やってもなれないなあ... （笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/09/08/3801014/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}